RES_SH_TIPS_TITLE=Tips
RES_SH_TIPS_TEXT=• Resource packs change the visual appearance of blocks, items, and UI\n• Shader packs add advanced visual effects like shadows, lighting, and water reflections\n• Shader packs require OptiFine, Iris (Fabric/Quilt), or Oculus (Forge) to work\n• Resource packs can be .zip files or folders containing pack.mcmeta\n• Shader packs are usually .zip files\n• Browse popular sites like CurseForge, Modrinth, or Planet Minecraft for packs
